EndeavourOS i3wm Keybindings cheat sheet:
(actualizado para coincidir con 02_keybindings)

--> to update this run the following command:
wget --backups=1 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/endeavouros-team/endeavouros-i3wm-setup/main/.config/i3/keybindings -P ~/.config/i3/

All sources and updates are available at GitHub:
https://github.com/endeavouros-team/endeavouros-i3wm-setup

For reference consult our WIKI:
https://discovery.endeavouros.com/window-tiling-managers/i3-wm/

 = windows key

# start xfce4-terminal
+Return

# kill focused window
+q
+c (alternativo)

# Application menu search by typing (fancy Rofi menu):
+a

# Window switcher menu (fancy Rofi menu):
+w

# fancy exit-menu:
+x

# Lock the system (blur screen):
+Alt+l

# reload the configuration file
+Shift+c

# restart i3 inplace (preserves your layout/session, can be used to upgrade i3)
Ctrl+Shift+r

# exit i3 session
+Shift+q

# keybinding in fancy rofi (automated)
F1

# full keybinding list in editor:
+F1

# change window focus (cursor keys):
+Left focus left
+Down focus down
+Up focus up
+Right focus right

# move a focused window (cursor keys):
+Shift+Left move left
+Shift+Down move down
+Shift+Up move up
+Shift+Right move right

# move container to next/prev workspace
+Ctrl+Right  move to next workspace
+Ctrl+Left   move to prev workspace

# split in horizontal orientation
+h split h

# split in vertical orientation
+v split v

# enter fullscreen mode for the focused container
+f fullscreen toggle

# change container layout
+Shift+s layout stacking
+Shift+t layout tabbed
+Shift+v layout toggle split (horizontal/vertical)
+Shift+d layout default
+Shift+l layout toggle (cycling)

# toggle tiling / floating
+space floating toggle

# change focus between tiling / floating windows
+Shift+space focus mode_toggle

# focus the parent container
+a focus parent

# focus the child container
+d focus child

# sticky floating window (always visible)
+Shift+o sticky toggle

# toggle border style
+y border toggle

# scratchpad
+minus       move to scratchpad
+Shift+minus show scratchpad

# resize floating windows (no resize mode needed)
+Alt+Left  shrink width
+Alt+Down  grow height
+Alt+Up    shrink height
+Alt+Right grow width

# move floating container
+Alt+c  move to center of screen
+Alt+p  move to mouse cursor position

# workspace back and forth
+b workspace back_and_forth
+Shift+b move container to previous workspace

# switch between workspaces (iterate)
+Tab     workspace next
+Shift+Tab workspace prev

# resize floating window (mouse)
+right mouse button

## Multimedia Keys

# Redirect sound to headphones / audio device switch
+p

## App shortcuts
+Shift+w starts Firefox
+Shift+f starts Thunar
